WEBVTT

NOTE Draft captions for listening review.

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:43.780
I’ve crossed the distance
I’ve carried the weight

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:52.260
I’ve counted my failures
I’ve questioned my faith

00:00:52.260 --> 00:01:00.660
But none of the darkness
And none of the years

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:09.380
Can silence Your promise
Or separate me here

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:13.300
Neither what I fear
Nor what I’ve done

00:01:13.300 --> 00:01:18.400
Can separate us,
Because of Your Son.

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:20.540
No height
No depth

00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:23.360
No fear
No death

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:26.780
Nothing between
Till my last breath.

00:01:26.780 --> 00:01:28.960
No loss
No pain

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:31.680
No guilt
No shame

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:39.080
Nothing Between.
Your love remains

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:48.520
Nothing between
My song remains

00:02:07.840 --> 00:02:16.900
When mountains surround me
When oceans divide

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:24.660
When yesterday haunts me
You're still by my side

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:33.020
No distance can hide me
No failure can change

00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:41.740
For Your love has found me,
You know me by name

00:02:41.740 --> 00:02:46.100
Not what I’ve lost
Not what I’ve been

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:50.700
Nothing can stand
Between us again

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:52.780
No height
No depth

00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:55.600
No fear
No death

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:59.120
Nothing between
Till my last breath.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:01.220
No loss
No pain

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:03.640
No guilt
No shame

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:11.000
Nothing Between.
Your love remains

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:20.800
Nothing between
My song remains

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:34.320
If I run

00:03:34.320 --> 00:03:38.480
You are there
If I fall

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:42.780
You are there
If I wander

00:03:42.780 --> 00:03:46.860
If I break
Your love

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:50.480
Does not change
Neither life

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:52.360
Nor death
Things to come

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:55.140
Things behind
Nothing

00:03:55.140 --> 00:04:01.740
Nothing
Keeps you from my side

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:10.160
No height
No depth

00:04:10.160 --> 00:04:15.400
No fear
No death

00:04:15.400 --> 00:04:18.540
Nothing between
Till my last breath.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:20.660
No loss
No pain

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:23.360
No guilt
No shame

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:30.740
Nothing Between.
Your love remains

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:44.440
Nothing between
My song remains

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:49.940
No power
No distance

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:52.480
No darkness
No grave

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:56.620
Nothing between
Nothing between.

00:04:56.620 --> 00:05:00.720
Nothing in creation
Can take me away

00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:04.940
Held by Your mercy
Kept by Your grace

00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:12.300
Nothing between us
My prayer and my praise.

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:19.080
Nothing between

00:05:19.080 --> 00:05:25.080
Your mercy, Your grace.

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:36.860
Nothing between

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:42.860
Your love remains
